      "title": "Core Switch SNMP Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "SNMP reachability status of Kenya Airways core distribution and datacenter switches. Values: 1 = Available/Responding, 0 = Timeout/Unreachable. Source: Zabbix zabbix[host,snmp,available] internal metric. Limitations: Verifies UDP/161 polling response; does not measure packet forwarding throughput. Missing data indicates collector outage, agent failure, or network disruption; values are preserved as null gaps."
