      "title": "ICMP Latency",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Round-trip ping response time between the Nawari monitoring collector and the core switch management interface. Units: Milliseconds (ms). Source: Zabbix icmppingsec metric. Warning: > 10ms, Critical: > 50ms. Limitations: Control plane ICMP response is low priority and may spike during high control plane CPU without impacting forwarding plane traffic. Missing data indicates collector outage, agent failure, or network disruption; values are preserved as null gaps."
    },
